		(uuid "f9ef6cf0-6607-44c4-8fdd-cf18a5c2336c")
	)
	(text_box "SPI flash sits on the FPGA's dedicated \nmaster-SPI config pins: CCLK C11, FCS_B K19, \nDQ0-3 on D18/D19/G18/F18. Read at power-up. \n\nmicroSD runs the native 4-bit SD bus, not SPI: \nCLK and CMD in bank 34, DAT0/DAT1/DAT3 in 16 \nand DAT2 in 35 -- none of them on the config bus."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
